    "description": "**Job Title:** Technical Support Engineer \u2013 Hardware & CCTV (Field Role)\n\n**Location:** Gandhipuram, Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu  \n**Work Mode:** Full-Time | Field & In-Office\n\n**Eligibility**\n\n* Diploma in Computer Science / IT\n* B.Sc. (CS / IT) or BCA\n* Freshers welcome \u2013 training provided\n* **Note:** BE / BTech candidates are not eligible\n\n**Salary**\n\n\u20b910,000 \u2013 \u20b912,000 per month\n\n* Performance-based incentives\n* Travel allowance\n\n**About the Role**\n\nWe are hiring a **Technical Support Engineer** for our client company to assist with **computer hardware, software, basic networking, and CCTV installation & maintenance**. This is a **field-based role** involving client visits and hands-on technical work.\n\nThis position is ideal for candidates who want **practical IT exposure and long-term growth in system support roles**.\n\n**What You Will Learn & Do (Training Provided)**\n\n* Desktop & laptop assembly and troubleshooting\n* OS installation (Windows, basic Linux)\n* Basic networking setup (IP configuration, routers, file sharing)\n* CCTV installation, DVR/NVR configuration, and maintenance\n* On-site technical support for clients\n* Maintaining service and repair logs\n\n**Requirements**\n\n* Basic computer hardware/software knowledge\n* Interest in learning networking and CCTV systems\n* Good communication skills with clients and team members\n* Must own a two-wheeler with valid driving license\n* Willingness to travel to client locations in and around Coimbatore\n\n**Why Join Us**\n\n* Structured hands-on training provided\n* Real-time field exposure with experienced technicians\n* Strong foundation for careers in IT support & system maintenance\n* Skill-based growth and performance incentives\n\n**Important**\n\nThis is a **field-based, on-site role**.  \nCandidates seeking remote or desk-only work should not apply.\n\n**Apply here in job portal or by sending your resume to:** softscholarshrd@gmail.com\n\nJob Type: Full-time\n\nPay: \u20b910,000.00 - \u20b915,000.00 per month\n\nBenefits:\n\n* Flexible schedule\n\nAbility to commute/relocate:\n\n* Gandhipuram, Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu: Reliably commute or planning to relocate before starting work (Required)\n\nEducation:\n\n* Diploma (Required)\n\nLanguage:\n\n* Tamil and English (Required)\n\nLicense/Certification:\n\n* Driving Licence (Required)\n\nWork Location: In person",
