    "description": "Job Title: **Trainee Detailer**\n\nRole Overview\n\nWe are looking for a motivated and detail-oriented Trainee Detailer to join our PEB detailing team. This role is ideal for **fresh graduates** or candidates at the beginning of their careers who are eager to learn structural steel and Pre-Engineered Building (PEB) detailing. As a Trainee Detailer, you will work closely with experienced detailers to develop your technical skills while contributing to the preparation of detailed drawings and project documentation.\n\nKey Responsibilities1. Drawing Preparation & Detailing Support\n\n* Assist in preparing shop drawings, erection drawings, and General Arrangement (GA) drawings for PEB projects.\n* Support senior detailers in creating and updating structural and fabrication drawings using CAD software.\n* Learn to interpret engineering drawings, project specifications, and design requirements.\n* Assist in making drawing revisions based on internal reviews and client comments.\n* Ensure drawings are prepared accurately and follow established quality standards.\n\n2. Learning & Technical Development\n\n* Develop an understanding of PEB structures, steel components, connections, and fabrication processes.\n* Learn industry standards, detailing practices, and project workflows.\n* Participate in technical training sessions\n* Continuously improve CAD drafting and detailing skills.\n\n3. Documentation & BOM Support\n\n* Assist in preparing Bills of Materials (BOMs) for structural steel components.\n* Support the maintenance of drawing records, revisions, and project documentation.\n* Help organize project files and ensure proper document control procedures are followed.\n\n4. Team Coordination\n\n* Work closely with senior detailers teams to understand project requirements.\n* Communicate effectively with team members regarding drawing updates and project progress.\n* Support project timelines by completing assigned tasks within deadlines.\n* Assist in resolving basic drawing-related issues under guidance from senior team members.\n\nJob Requirements & ProficienciesSoftware Skills\n\n* Basic knowledge of CAD software.\n* Familiarity with Microsoft Excel and other basic office tools.\n\nTechnical Knowledge\n\n* Basic understanding of engineering drawings and drafting concepts.\n* Interest in structural steel detailing and PEB structures.\n* Willingness to learn fabrication and erection detailing practices.\n\nSoft Skills\n\n* Strong attention to detail and accuracy.\n* Good communication and teamwork skills.\n* Positive attitude and eagerness to learn.\n* Ability to follow instructions and take ownership of assigned tasks.\n* Problem-solving mindset and willingness to ask questions when needed.\n\nAcademic Background & ExperienceEducation\n\n* Diploma or Bachelor's Degree in Civil Engineering, Mechanical Engineering, or a related field.\n\nExperience\n\n* **Freshers are encouraged to apply.**\n* Candidates with up to 1 year of experience in CAD drafting or detailing may also apply.\n* CAD training or certification will be an added advantage.\n\nJob Perks & Why Join UsLearning & Development\n\n* Structured training and hands-on exposure to PEB detailing projects.\n* Opportunity to learn from experienced engineers and detailers.\n\nGlobal Exposure\n\n* Work on projects for international clients and gain exposure to global detailing standards.\n\nCareer Growth\n\n* Clear career progression opportunities within the detailing team.\n* Continuous technical and professional development support.\n\nSupportive Environment\n\n* Collaborative workplace where learning, innovation, and growth are encouraged.\n* Opportunity to contribute to real projects from the beginning of your career.\n\nHow to Apply\n\nIf you're eager to build a career in PEB detailing and want to learn from industry professionals, send your updated resume to **hr@enternetz.in**.\n\nLearn more about us at **www.enternetz.in**\n\nPay: \u20b915,500.00 - \u20b920,000.00 per month\n\nBenefits:\n\n* Health insurance\n* Leave encashment\n* Paid time off\n* Provident Fund\n\nWork Location: In person",
